d study of treatment duration and ribavirin dose</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>140</volume><fpage>346</fpage><lpage>355</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14996676</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B25"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Sood</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Midha</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Sood</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Bansal</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><article-title>Pegylated interferon alfa 2b and oral ribavirin in patients with HCV-related cirrhosis</article-title><source>Indian J Gastroenterol</source><year>2006</year><volume>25</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>283</fpage><lpage>285</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17264426</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B26"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Sulkowski</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Wasserman</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Brooks</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Gish</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><article-title>Changes in Haemoglobin during Interferon alpha-2b Plus Ribavirin Combination Therapy for Chronic Hepatitis C virus Infection</article-title><source>J Viral Hepat</source><year>2004</year><volume>11</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>243</fpage><lpage>50</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2893.2004.00490.x</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15117326</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B27"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Shiffman</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><article-title>Side Effects of Medical Therapy for Chronic Hepatitis C</article-title><source>Ann Hepatol</source><year>2004</year><volume>3</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>5</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-typ